    LLM: '1. Opening: First betting round occurs after the initial 5 cards are dealt.\n2. First Draw: Players may discard any number of cards and receive new ones from the dealer.\n3. Second Betting: A second round of betting takes place.\n4. Second Draw: Players may discard and draw a second time.\n5. Final Betting: The final round of betting occurs before the showdown.',
